点或 node_keys 批量\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_mount_device\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_write\",\n      \"description\": \"挂载设备到父节点（updateDeviceParent）；支持 node_key 或 node_keys 批量\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_get_device_tree\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_read\",\n      \"description\": \"读取边缘完整设备树（getDeviceTree）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_get_device_list\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_read\",\n      \"description\": \"读取设备档案/子树列表\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_get_device_parameters\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_read\",\n      \"description\": \"通用读设备当前参数项（getDeviceParam）；网关默认20100024、监测点默认20200002，可传 item_ids 读任意项；模板/免模板直连代理均支持\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_save_device_parameters\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_write\",\n      \"description\": \"当前plan独立确认后保存网关20100024或回读XLBA参数；支持 node_key 或 node_keys 批量\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_set_device_param\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_write\",\n      \"description\": \"批量/全量下发，不区分类型；模板会话按填报值、免模板直连会话逐台先读后端当前参数(20200002)，读不到则从设备档案(getDeviceList)组装 itemBody 后下发；仅 rtnCode=0 计成功\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_call_clock\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_write\",\n      \"description\": \"独立确认召测网关时钟，无建档前置；不校时\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_call_monitor_debug\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_write\",\n      \"description\": \"31800006监测点召测；rtnCode=0表示召测成功\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"execute_archive_task\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_write\",\n      \"description\": \"一键执行建档任务（完整/独立）；task_id 模式支持 stages 子集与 batch_size/budget 分批推进，返回续跑游标 cursor/remaining；独立模式对已存在网关执行时钟/下发/召测\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"get_device_archive_task_report\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_read\",\n      \"description\": \"按归属查询持久阶段报告，支持任务会话过期后查询\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_check_monitor_online\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_read\",\n      \"description\": \"按设备类型判监测点在线（照明/配电房走感知事件，XLBA 走运维召测；模板与免模板直连/代理均支持，不阻塞）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_call_device_data\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_write\",\n      \"description\": \"旧召测兼容入口已阻断，不可替代31800006验收\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_apply_compensation_plan\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_write\",\n      \"description\": \"按补偿清单确认式删除本次新建设备\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_get_token\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_util\",\n      \"description\": \"独立登录边缘后端，返回 task_id 供后续 edge_* 工具使用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"edge_delete_device\",\n      \"type\": \"edge_write\",\n      \"description\": \"删除设备（自动递归删除子设备，叶子优先）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"validate_config_format\",\n      \"type\": \"exec\",\n      \"description\": \"校验转换配置 JSON 结构（MQTT/HTTP/Modbus 三契约，不执行）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"generate_test_data\",\n      \"type\": \"exec\",\n      \"description\": \"生成 normal/boundary/abnormal 三组测试输入\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"execute_conversion_test\",\n      \"type\": \"exec\",\n      \"description\": \"沙箱执行转换测试并返回结构化报告（MQTT/HTTP）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"get_test_report\",\n      \"type\": \"exec\",\n      \"description\": \"按 test_run_id 查询测试报告（归属校验）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"save_conversion_config\",\n      \"type\": \"exec\",\n      \"description\": \"校验并保存转换配置 JSON（30 天 TTL）\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"pack_bundle\",\n      \"type\": \"exec\",\n      \"description\": \"打包配置+文档+测试报告为 ZIP（测试门控）\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "is_error": null}}
